  "details": "(As attached picture)\n\n1. Click view on website\n\n2. If you are login, it will bring you to the world details(*BUG 1, it should bring you to the \"Launch site\", since I assume the button is for 'sharing the instance', which didn't named, but the feature do looks like that)\n\n3. If you didn't login, it will bring you to the launch site, which is correct, but there's a BUG 2, since it should not be a whole new 'Public' instance(it should be 'THE' instance)\n\n4. If you want to obtain the correct site for be able to share the instance direct link, you will have to login and click from here\n\nBtw, if you didn't login, it will bring you to the loopback to make you confuse and click a lot more things for the simple instance link: https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/view-world-details-button-loopback-without-login\n\nBtw2, if the button is not designed for the instance sharing(which it should), then the instance page should get a new 'Share' button for the instance sharing, then\n\nBtw3, as Picture 5, this include select the portal and open website",
